# Cisco skill-scanner "Static + LLM" through OpenAI. Usage is billed to your OpenAI account.
# Copy to .scanners/skill-scanner-openai.env and put your key after the = sign
# (install.sh can do this for you). The .scanners/ folder is never committed.
SKILL_SCANNER_LLM_API_KEY=
SKILL_SCANNER_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.4
